            "title": "Elizabeth Pulles ",
            "summary": "Most Recent Picture Books Illustrated Thokozani The Eland ( Gcina Mhlophe )&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>Most <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Recent Picture Books Illustrated</span></p>\n<p>Thokozani The Eland      ( <em>Gcina Mhlophe )     </em>Jacana Children's Books 2025</p>\n<p>Mr Fitchelstein' Safari Company      ( <em>Lauri Kabuitsile )</em>     Modjaji Books 2025</p>\n<p>Nomkhubulwane, African Mother Xmas      ( <em>Gcina Mhlophe )     </em>New Africa Books 2024</p>\n<p>The Joy Dancer     <em>(Gregory Maqoma)      </em>Jacana Children's Books 2023</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Most Recent Chapter Books Illustrated</span></p>\n<p>Golden Girl      ( <em>Lorato Trok with Wendy Hartman )</em>      Jacana Children's Books 2024</p>\n<p>One Step At a Time      <em>( Gregory Maqoma )      </em>Jacana Children's Books 2024</p>\n<p>Together Apart      <em>( Xolisa Guzula &amp; Atambile Masola )      </em>Jacana Media 2024</p>\n<p>Ster en die Skugter Vyf      <em>( Henriette Linde-Loubser )      </em>Tafelberg 2020</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Awards</span></p>\n<p>MER award   ( <em>best picture book )</em></p>\n<p>Exclusive Books / IBBY ( <em>best picture book illustrations South Africa</em> )</p>\n<p>Vivienne Wilkes award ( <em>best picture book illustrations over two years</em><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">)</span></p>\n<p>ATKV award     ( <em>best picture book illustrations</em> )</p>\n<p>Daan Retief Publisher's Award     ( <em>best picture book illustrations</em> )</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Elizabeth Pulles works across the fields of picture book fiction and non fiction,as well as illustration work for educational books and teaching material. She is working on a new picture book at the moment of which she is both writer and illustrator.  She is currently living in Johannesburg, South Africa. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"align-left\"> </p>\n<p class=\"align-left\">   </p>",
